        24.738352605042017,
        110.73986787410934,
        973.8912742857143,
        10.613680225653184
      ],
      "text": "transaction based on changes in foreign tax law, illegality or certain other events or circumstances. In such a case, American may be required to",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/QFUCAA+DejaVuSans",
        "size": 13
