        374.5221570665084,
        973.8912742857143,
        10.613680225653184
      ],
      "text": "agreements allow these credit card processing companies, under certain conditions, to hold an amount of its cash (referred to as a holdback) equal to",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
