      "bbox": [
        42.608149201680675,
        458.7088034441806,
        956.0470251680672,
        10.613680225653184
      ],
      "text": "As of December 31, 2020, American employed approximately 78,300 active full-time equivalent (FTE) employees. Of the total active FTE",
      "font": {
        "color": [
